CJ  ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌  ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌  ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌  ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌  ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌
 

https://click.hi.cj.com/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjQ5NDR9AA0AAAAAAL6LxDOIhdnqdCTa5kwhpfm_AzAX9h5_RhnTmClWWhNojiYDcsmDfHfkwcRmF2DsAO5_zAhXjmhTPROtGTX-VmIODO8_Rn-JQspkt2G7 

 





 Hello,


 The digital landscape is evolving rapidly, with tracking and privacy standards changing quickly across browsers, mobile environments, and consumer preferences. These developments are affecting how affiliate activities are measured and how revenue is attributed throughout the ecosystem.


 In response to these changes, CJ is dedicated to ensuring tracking integrity for Publishers. We are continually enhancing our tools and insights to protect your traffic, promote accurate attribution, and ensure fair compensation.

What is CJ doing about it?


 CJ is conducting comprehensive tracking diagnostics across Advertiser programs. The goal is to create greater awareness of integration status and identify vulnerabilities that may cause tracking gaps. By working collaboratively with Advertisers, we aim to resolve any gaps through integration upgrades and maintain robust tracking standards. We recognize that in certain instances Advertisers may not be able to close all tracking gaps. In those cases Advertisers will be assessed reconciliations, which are customized calculations for tracking gaps that will be calculated on a program-by-program basis based on the tracking vulnerabilities.


 Reconciliations will be rolling out in phases across applicable Advertisers. To see reconciliation payments attributed to your account, navigate to Reports > 
https://click.hi.cj.com/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjQ5NDR9AA0AAAAAAL6LxDOJm8KPKpYu4LtLegYP8eNzGPggNSbQCtg5T4BzYMOswZz6dE601xkzQdFBJJjsA9qW6oK9Y5E6vK_NxfWgQ77F12C5t6rZKmiQ 
Partner Payments  and filter for Payment Category = Reconciliations (this will be live mid-to-late July).


 For more details about our tracking standards, you can refer to our 
https://click.hi.cj.com/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjQ5NDR9AA0AAAAAAL6LxDOKCk-pr9qghrJ9ofyAbcYq_bgpoXDlDNDbsZPYYABxCmW_libtw0GGTiatNrRhYz1OsUJBHk_co93sd3PNNygyZOqgfbdlrVyY 
integration doc .

Why is this important?


 Upgrading integrations is essential for improving data accuracy and truly reflecting program performance. Accurate insights and a strong attribution environment are critical for your ongoing success. CJ is committed to providing this foundation for both Publishers and Advertisers.

What can I do?


 Although Advertisers manage their own program integrations, CJ offers a range of Publisher-side solutions to support tracking resilience and safeguard your revenue:

	- Publisher Tag: A lightweight script that enables bounceless tracking on eligible journeys, provides more consistent attribution across browsers, and improves the user experience.
	- Publisher Tracking API: A server-side method designed for publishers with advanced technical capabilities. It offers first-party identity and high tracking resilience, even in restrictive environments.

 If you can leverage any of the Publisher-side solutions, please reach out to your CJ Team or through CJ&rsquo;s Support Center to get started on integration steps. For Support Cases, use the following details:

	- 
 Case Reason: Publisher Tracking
	- 
 Case Sub-Reason: select &ldquo;Publisher API&rdquo; or &ldquo;Publisher Tag&rdquo;
	- 
 Subject line: Publisher Tracking Integration Review

 Additionally, it is crucial to practice good link maintenance. Review the links you&rsquo;re using across your traffic sources to ensure they are current, active, and aligned with advertiser‑provided URLs. Remove outdated or inactive links, confirm they resolve to live landing pages, and regenerate links through CJ when needed. Keeping your links clean and up to date helps preserve attribution accuracy and prevents missed commission opportunities.


 CJ is committed to supporting you as the digital landscape continues to evolve.


 Best,

 CJ






